<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ACT Networks raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ACT Networks raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it upgraded ACT Networks Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited strong business trends, positive outlook for new products.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-3/4 to 29-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
